  "diagnosis": "Reproduced: biome format --stdin-file-path=.codictator/tasks/T-9999.json turns the 2-space stableStringify record into tab-indented text. Root cause: SPEC 4.1.2 mandates 2-space stableStringify for every generated JSON file and task and review records (SPEC 7.11) use it, but biome.json only exempts .codictator/*.json (top level), not .codictator/tasks/ or .codictator/reviews/, so the tab formatter flags every CLI write. SPEC is consistent, so the writer stays and the fix is a formatter-disabled biome override for those two directories.",
